        "original_id": "46d622ed-3a93-5dec-b665-8e9fb1fa3ba4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: To Catch a Predator, Dateline NBC, The Break-Up\n- People: Chris Hansen, Rachel Dratch, Keith Powell, Lonny Ross, Dean Winters\n- Topics: hidden camera investigations, Internet sex predator sting operations, ages of consent in North America\n\nFacts:\n- The ages of consent in North America for sexual activity vary by jurisdiction.\n- To Catch a Predator was an American reality television series featuring hidden camera investigations by Dateline NBC.\n- To Catch a Predator focused on impersonating underage people, generally ages 13–15, and detaining adult men who contacted them online for sexual liaisons.\n- Chris Hansen was known for his work on Dateline NBC, especially the former segment To Catch a Predator about sting operations targeting potential Internet sex predators.\n- The 30 Rock episode The Break-Up had guest stars Rachel Dratch, Chris Hansen, Keith Powell, Lonny Ross, and Dean Winters.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
